WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:02.990
Unit eight. Sleep Routines!

2
00:00:03.966 --> 00:00:07.752
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:11.557
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.607 --> 00:00:15.475
Today we learn about Sleep Routines. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.428 --> 00:00:19.795
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

6
00:00:23.295 --> 00:00:26.495
Routine. Say it with me. Routine!

7
00:00:29.995 --> 00:00:33.729
Bedtime. Say it with me. Bedtime!

8
00:00:37.221 --> 00:00:40.504
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

9
00:00:44.062 --> 00:00:47.396
Dark. Say it with me. Dark!

10
00:00:50.838 --> 00:00:54.205
Quiet. Say it with me. Quiet!

11
00:00:57.706 --> 00:01:01.356
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

12
00:01:04.839 --> 00:01:08.639
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

13
00:01:12.159 --> 00:01:21.320
A bedtime routine helps me sleep well. I turn off the screen, brush my teeth, and read in a quiet room. A dark room helps my body rest and gives me energy.

14
00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:22.588
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.013 --> 00:01:29.279
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.329 --> 00:01:30.479
Bedtime!

17
00:01:31.295 --> 00:01:36.612
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:37.812
Rest!

19
00:01:38.699 --> 00:01:44.231
Did you know? Going to bed at the same time every night helps your body clock!

20
00:01:44.281 --> 00:01:46.316
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.016 --> 00:01:54.328
Think and answer. What is your bedtime routine?

22
00:01:54.378 --> 00:01:55.528
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.646 --> 00:02:01.365
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.415 --> 00:02:03.969
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

